{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Devil's Terminal</i> is a Japanese Americana coming-of-age RPG about killing a demon at summer camp. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/86aadb74d7b9e4af2d65f97be83b4f68.poster.avif?t=1771855859\" width=614 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/86aadb74d7b9e4af2d65f97be83b4f68.webm?t=1771855859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/86aadb74d7b9e4af2d65f97be83b4f68.mp4?t=1771855859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMON</strong><br>Being a teenager feels like being possessed. There\u2019s a demon that wants to keep you a loser. It wants you to suffer. It is the reason why teenagers write bad poetry. It is terrifying. Kill it, or die alone. \u263a\ufe0e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DICE</strong><br>RPGs should have dice. A way to check your skills against something. In Devil\u2019s Terminal, you check against an evil Demon who is trying to control your life. Every choice needs to be wrestled from it. Wager your life or give up and let it run the show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASSES</strong><br>Figure out who you want to be. By the end of this summer, you\u2019ll either become somebody, or stay a nobody. The demon will try to stop you from getting new skills. The computer will help. Find the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COOL KIDS</strong><br>You\u2019re surrounded by rebels. This is a camp for troubled children, but everyone\u2019s troubles are cooler than yours. Try to fit in with misfits. Try to go on a date with one. Try to make friends with another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/e72588e1496f5f41661cdd45f6ce3a52.poster.avif?t=1771855859\" width=800 height=1671 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/e72588e1496f5f41661cdd45f6ce3a52.webm?t=1771855859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171510?t=1771855859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171510?t=1771855859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/c33190425539ddaaff8dde5a7eaff51e1a9d4d9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771855859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/c33190425539ddaaff8dde5a7eaff51e1a9d4d9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771855859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3456750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Chat With The Team</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/1951c426ebf6e4ed3afa7c3c1124e065.avif?t=1771855859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras_big/1951c426ebf6e4ed3afa7c3c1124e065.avif?t=1771855859 width=800 height=184 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Devil's Terminal</i> is a Japanese Americana coming-of-age RPG about killing a demon at summer camp. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 